    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1284" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδιά-κρῐτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>undistinguishable,
			mixed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				570
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Somn.Vig.</u>
					458a21
				</span></i>
			 (
				Comp.
			); <i>not discriminated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				35
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>
			<i>without distinction, in common</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				105
			</span></i> H., <i><span class="en">
				Hierocl.
				<u>in CA</u>
				12p.446M.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				4.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				89.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>promiscuous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιμιξίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					19.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unintelligible</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				15.12.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>undecided</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				509.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Aphrodisias</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>not making due distinctions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -τον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.664
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				<i>without examination,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					POxy.
					715.36
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>.</div>
